# Dedicated Solana devnet RPC. The Helius API key is embedded in the URL, so treat the whole
# endpoint as a secret.
#
# RPC      — scripts: bringup-venue, market-maker, verify-venue, setup-faucet-venue
# RPC_URL  — server-side API routes (/api/book, /api/activity, /api/faucet). Never reaches the browser.
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_RPC_URL is deliberately NOT set here: anything NEXT_PUBLIC_* is bundled into the client
# JS and visible to every visitor, so a keyed endpoint there is a key anyone can drain. The browser
# falls back to public devnet, and the heavy read path (the book) is served by the cached endpoints
# above, which do use the dedicated RPC.
RPC=https://devnet.helius-rpc.com/?api-key=YOUR_KEY_HERE
RPC_URL=https://devnet.helius-rpc.com/?api-key=YOUR_KEY_HERE

# Faucet signer (JSON array). Locally this is read from deploy/faucet-keypair.json instead.
# FAUCET_SECRET=[...]

# Pyth Hermes credentials — only needed for the live mark on the listed tickers (NVDA, SPY).
# Feed ids resolve without it; the price endpoint returns 401 without it.
# PYTH_API_KEY=
